.007144822273403406,0.015784790739417076,0.01675564981997013,-0.0028944306541234255,0.034886401146650314,0.004841358866542578,0.01761576719582081,-0.0007496933685615659,-0.004046404268592596,0.012874569743871689,-0.00559514295309782,-0.013827837072312832,-0.0227866992354393,0.0035165376029908657,-0.020405391231179237,-0.0060027362778782845,-0.01040055975317955,0.006174182519316673,0.016044534742832184,0.03599030524492264,-0.007196488324552774,Multi-Modal Data Fusion,"AI systems often need to make decisions or understand complex situations based on information from disparate sources and modalities, which individually might be incomplete, ambiguous, or provide different perspectives.",Applications requiring a comprehensive understanding of an environment or situation by combining data from various sensors or data streams.,"An AI system integrates and processes data from multiple modalities (e.g., satellite imagery, video, radar, infrared, geolocation data, text from social media). This involves aligning, combining, and often transforming these diverse data types into a unified, richer representation for analysis and decision-making.","A more robust, complete, and accurate understanding of the environment or situation, enabling the AI to identify patterns, objects, or events that would be difficult or impossible to detect using a single data source. Improved reliability in complex, real-world scenarios.","Military intelligence, autonomous driving, surveillance, medical diagnostics, environmental monitoring, robotics.",
