1616731286049,0.00936922151595354,0.01792105846107006,0.0015581372426822782,0.010083222761750221,-0.005013792775571346,0.009691311977803707,-0.007359521463513374,-0.008109844289720058,-0.01641106978058815,-0.028011785820126534,0.014828153885900974,-0.01931529864668846,0.0010397752048447728,0.013062521815299988,-0.00966570433229208,-0.004028263967484236,0.026190511882305145,-0.013037547469139099,Dynamic Grounded Replanning,"Static plans generated by LLMs often lack physical grounding to the current environment, leading to incorrect objects, unattainable plans, or agents getting stuck during execution in partially-observable environments.","An embodied agent is executing a high-level plan generated by an LLM in a dynamic, partially-observable environment. The initial plan might become invalid or suboptimal due to unforeseen circumstances or incomplete environmental knowledge.","Whenever the agent encounters a failure (e.g., fails to execute an action, takes too many steps for a subgoal) or after a fixed number of steps, dynamically prompt the LLM again. The prompt includes the list of objects currently perceived in the environment and the completed partial high-level plan. The LLM then generates a new, more grounded continuation of the plan.","Enables LLMs to dynamically adapt generated high-level plans to the current environmental perception, helping the agent overcome unattainable plans, find alternative solutions (e.g., looking for a potato in a fridge if not found elsewhere), and achieve a closed-loop interaction between the environment and the LLM.",LLMPlanner.,
