639,-0.01303096767514944,-0.006560162641108036,0.010355307720601559,0.010273764841258526,0.009453384205698967,0.02106613852083683,0.008397658355534077,0.01174007449299097,-0.0065766433253884315,0.006111330818384886,-0.0012031738879159093,-0.009695966728031635,-0.009016706608235836,-0.03508473187685013,0.021269652992486954,-0.019806979224085808,0.0011263474589213729,0.0059517258778214455,-0.003750837640836835,0.010349621064960957,0.027074750512838364,-0.016185959801077843,LLM Planner-Actor Feedback Loop,"High-level plans generated by an LLM might need dynamic adjustment based on real-time environmental feedback, and the LLM itself needs to be informed of the outcomes of its plans to enable iterative refinement.","An LLM acts as a planner, generating a sequence of actions or sub-goals, while a separate agent (actor) executes these low-level actions in the environment. The environment is dynamic and uncertain.","Establish a closed-loop feedback mechanism where the LLM (planner) proposes actions, the actor executes them, and the environment's state changes and outcomes are reported back to the LLM. This allows the LLM to iteratively refine its plans or generate new ones based on the observed outcomes.","Enables more robust and adaptive planning, as the LLM can correct its course or generate new strategies in response to unexpected environmental dynamics or execution failures, leading to more successful task completion.","Textual adventure games, robotics, any domain requiring iterative planning and execution where the LLM needs to adapt its strategy based on real-world feedback.",
