6,0.007268995977938175,0.014494908973574638,0.010419437661767006,0.014182563871145248,0.011458844877779484,0.010196594521403313,-0.00455264188349247,0.007004931103438139,-0.0019014112185686827,-0.009563975036144257,-0.00904858484864235,-0.03393588960170746,0.014013907872140408,-0.01735685206949711,-0.0022086200769990683,0.006188588682562113,-0.0052429260686039925,0.007275813724845648,0.03162846341729164,-0.020966073498129845,LLM Planner with Environmental Reporter,"Raw environmental observations might be too complex, noisy, or low-level for an LLM planner to effectively process and incorporate into its planning process, leading to inefficient or suboptimal plans.","An LLM acts as a planner within a closed-loop feedback system, receiving information about the environment's state. The raw observations from the environment are often high-dimensional or contain irrelevant details for high-level planning.","Introduce an intermediate 'reporter' component that observes the environment, processes raw observations, and extracts or summarizes useful, high-level information relevant to the LLM planner. This summarized information is then fed back to the LLM.","The LLM planner receives more actionable and concise information, improving its ability to reason and generate effective plans by abstracting away irrelevant details from raw observations, thus enhancing planning efficiency and quality.","Complex textual environments, robotics with high-dimensional sensor data, where LLMs benefit from pre-processed and contextualized information for planning.",
