44,0.018714481964707375,0.015192024409770966,0.019045619294047356,-0.002813703380525112,0.010029396042227745,0.004034418147057295,-0.0004690092755481601,0.012216598726809025,-0.003800940001383424,-0.00833357498049736,-0.01452492643147707,2.576088263595011e-05,-0.031050091609358788,-0.0034705225843936205,-0.008514137007296085,0.00022557545162271708,0.027213850989937782,0.027214415371418,-0.01941859908401966,Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF),"Aligning Large Language Models (LLMs) to human preferences, values, and instructions, especially for subjective tasks like text generation, where a simple objective function is hard to define and traditional supervised learning falls short.","An LLM generates text (e.g., responses, summaries). Human feedback is available on the quality, helpfulness, safety, or style of these generations, but this feedback is often qualitative or comparative.","Train a reward model (RM) using human preferences (e.g., pairwise comparisons of LLM outputs). Then, use this learned RM to provide a scalar reward signal to an Reinforcement Learning (RL) algorithm (e.g., PPO), which finetunes the LLM. The LLM's actions are token generations, and the state is the prompt or partial generation.","The LLM generates text that is better aligned with human preferences, often leading to more helpful, honest, and harmless outputs. This approach can significantly improve the perceived quality and safety of LLM outputs, even with models of moderate size.","Improving conversational AI, content generation, summarization, and generally aligning LLMs with human values and instructions for various text-based tasks.",
