5285625,0.02010693959891796,0.013724668882787228,0.012575657106935978,0.0009170699631795287,0.014314140193164349,-0.017846565693616867,0.0036226955708116293,0.0009798366809263825,-0.017087422311306,-0.012883204966783524,-0.024370310828089714,0.010569476522505283,-0.0247623510658741,-0.008693634532392025,0.010841705836355686,0.006672508083283901,0.01462289784103632,0.023643074557185173,-0.01265496201813221,Contextual Prompt Structuring for RL Agents,"An LLM acting as an agent's policy needs to receive all necessary information (goal, current state, available actions, short-term memory) in a structured and effective way within a single prompt to make informed and coherent decisions in sequential tasks.","An LLM is used as a policy in an interactive environment, where the agent's decision-making depends on the current goal, observation, and recent history of interactions. The prompt is the primary interface for conveying this information to the LLM.","Design a prompt template that systematically includes: 1) A header listing all possible actions (to explicitly define the action space for the LLM). 2) The explicit goal of the agent (to guide its objective). 3) A short-term memory component, typically consisting of the last few observations and actions, to provide temporal context and enable sequential reasoning.","The LLM receives a comprehensive and structured input, enabling it to leverage its pre-trained knowledge and contextual understanding to select appropriate actions, especially in environments requiring memory or sequential reasoning, leading to improved task performance.",Any LLM-based agent in interactive environments requiring contextual awareness and memory; improving decision-making in sequential tasks by providing structured historical context.,
