0.02908010222017765,0.02207358181476593,0.014380856417119503,0.013616029173135757,-0.01896100677549839,0.011226163245737553,-0.004395355936139822,0.015115339308977127,0.006878098007291555,-0.0002830452867783606,-0.029669087380170822,-0.023719796910881996,0.0003348187601659447,-0.03101668506860733,0.00036319796345196664,-0.015154296532273293,-0.0005947706522420049,0.014871673658490181,0.03461707383394241,-0.008674504235386848,Chunking Strategy Optimization,"Dividing large documents into chunks for indexing and retrieval is critical, but an arbitrary chunking strategy can lead to loss of context, splitting of important information, or chunks that are too large/small, hindering retrieval effectiveness.",When preparing a knowledge base for any retrieval system (especially vector databases for dense retrieval) where documents need to be broken down into manageable units.,"Systematically optimize how documents are split into chunks. This involves considering factors like optimal chunk size, overlap between chunks, and respecting semantic boundaries (e.g., paragraphs, headings, code blocks) to ensure each chunk is self-contained yet provides sufficient context.","Improves the relevance and coherence of retrieved chunks, ensuring that the context provided to the generative model is meaningful and complete, thereby enhancing the quality of the final output.","Preparing data for vector databases, optimizing document indexing for RAG, ensuring contextual integrity in retrieved snippets.",
