4363,0.02226356789469719,0.01527371909469366,0.029890719801187515,-0.014305263757705688,1.3596614678590413e-07,-0.017302026972174644,0.009759437292814255,0.0037091716658324003,-0.0019432762637734413,-0.018942194059491158,-0.017880050465464592,0.01870862953364849,-0.018033400177955627,-0.005892244167625904,-0.004020612686872482,-0.015012483112514019,0.007446556352078915,0.017426706850528717,-0.02114528976380825,Routing Layer (Agentic Orchestration),"A single, monolithic RAG pipeline or generative model may not be optimal or sufficient for handling diverse user queries that require different tools, specialized models, or combinations of actions.","In complex AI systems where multiple specialized agents, tools, or RAG configurations exist, and the system needs to intelligently decide the best path to fulfill a user's request.","Implement an intelligent routing layer (often powered by an LLM) that analyzes the user's input and determines the most appropriate action. This could involve forwarding the request to a specific agent, combining results from multiple sources, or selecting a particular RAG pipeline configuration.","Enables the creation of more flexible, capable, and adaptive AI systems that can leverage a diverse set of tools and models to address a wider range of user needs.","Building multi-agent systems, dynamic tool selection, complex task execution, orchestrating different AI capabilities.",
