,0.0310677420347929,0.020795350894331932,0.011901618912816048,0.030287692323327065,0.01083866786211729,0.013807619921863079,-0.0059738983400166035,-0.006155790761113167,-0.004989038687199354,-0.020438628271222115,-0.01855875924229622,-0.020861981436610222,0.010988053865730762,-0.023921599611639977,-0.004114000592380762,0.01606454886496067,-0.004457781556993723,0.01421444397419691,0.029577942565083504,-0.017720168456435204,Passive goal creator,"Users may lack expertise in interacting with agents and the provided information can be ambiguous for goal achievement, leading to underspecification and impacting efficiency.","When querying agents to address certain issues, users provide related context and explain the goals in prompts.","A foundation model-based agent provides a dialogue interface where users can directly specify the context and problems. The passive goal creator analyzes these inputs and retrieves related information from memory (e.g., artifacts, tools, conversation histories, examples) to refine and clarify user goals. The agent passively receives input and generates strategies to refine and clarify goals.","{'Benefits': 'Interactivity, Goalseeking, Efficiency.', 'Drawbacks': 'Reasoning uncertainty due to varied user backgrounds and potentially unclear or ambiguous context information.'}",Liu et al. (2023a) designed an agent for refining research questions via a dialogue interface; Kannan et al. (2023) proposed an agent for decomposing tasks for robots through a dialogue interface; HuggingGPT interprets complex user requests via a chatbot.,
