19107914,0.02831949107348919,0.016609959304332733,0.020615175366401672,0.030295349657535553,0.01113841775804758,0.0170455239713192,-0.002642984502017498,-0.0015250275610014796,-0.00929610151797533,-0.008396708406507969,-0.017581336200237274,-0.01783321052789688,0.006836954969912767,-0.018342286348342896,0.00517716258764267,0.010338065214455128,-0.014090746641159058,-0.00538098718971014,0.03932064399123192,-0.016106804832816124,Proactive goal creator,"The context information collected solely via a dialogue interface may be limited, resulting in inaccurate responses to users' goals, especially due to underspecification and accessibility challenges.",Users explain the goals that the agent is expected to achieve in the prompt.,"In addition to prompts and memory retrieval, the proactive goal creator anticipates user goals by sending requirements to detectors that capture multimodal context (e.g., users' gestures through cameras, application UI layout via screenshots). This multimodal information is used for further analysis and comprehension to generate goals, with user notification to avoid unnecessary interruptions.","{'Benefits': 'Interactivity, Goalseeking (more detailed information), Accessibility (for disabled users).', 'Drawbacks': 'Overhead (increased cost for multimodal context capture), increased communication overhead if context information is limited.'}",GestureGPT (Zeng et al. 2023) deciphers hand gesture descriptions; Zhao et al. (2023b) proposed a programming screencast analysis tool; ProAgent (Zhang et al. 2023b) observes teammate behaviors to deduce intentions.,
