.0036083427257835865,0.026191802695393562,0.017813146114349365,0.009111486375331879,0.021004578098654747,0.0038493976462632418,0.011967480182647705,0.0008994750096462667,-0.0020267947111278772,-0.007923884317278862,-0.016278017312288284,-0.022235654294490814,-0.0321422703564167,0.007507963106036186,-0.02838985249400139,-0.008099550381302834,0.01252862811088562,0.00045229747775010765,0.0062712859362363815,0.03682558238506317,-0.011394600383937359,Incremental model querying,"The foundation model may struggle to generate the correct response at the first attempt. How can the agent conduct an accurate reasoning process, addressing limitations like context window size, oversimplification, and lack of explainability.","When users interact with the agent for specific goals, the included foundation model is queried for plan generation.","The agent engages in a step-by-step reasoning process to develop the plan for goal achievement with multiple queries to the foundation model. Human feedback can be provided at any time to both the reasoning process and generated plan, allowing for adjustments during model querying.","{'Benefits': 'Supplementary context (splitting context), Reasoning certainty, Explainability.', 'Drawbacks': 'Overhead (increased time consumption and cost for multiple interactions).'}",HuggingGPT queries the underlying foundation model multiple times to decompose requests; EcoAssistant (Zhang et al. 2023a) iteratively refines code; ReWOO (Xu et al. 2023) queries the foundation model to generate interdependent plans and combine observations.,
