12,0.008221970871090889,0.015558748506009579,0.01865156926214695,0.017982110381126404,0.03831399232149124,0.005673310719430447,0.0011663120239973068,-0.005284660961478949,-0.0008162300218828022,0.01972314342856407,-0.0019281443674117327,-0.020308412611484528,-0.0319172628223896,0.02568008005619049,-0.015262131579220295,-0.007912196218967438,0.017831847071647644,0.009245488792657852,-0.0020280187018215656,0.019058620557188988,-0.020614923909306526,Facilitator,"Agents need to locate other agents with specific capabilities, especially when agents are mobile and their location is not fixed or known in advance.","In a dynamic multi-agent system, agents may move frequently, making direct addressing difficult. Other agents need a way to discover and interact with agents providing specific services or information without knowing their current location.","Defines an agent that provides services for naming and locating agents with specific capabilities. It acts as a directory or yellow pages service for agents, allowing them to be found by symbolic, meaningful names.","Allows agents to be located by symbolic names rather than fixed addresses, supporting agent mobility and dynamic environments. Facilitates agent discovery and interaction in complex, distributed systems.","An information-gathering agent continuously moving, and other agents needing to retrieve updates from it without knowing its present location; assigning symbolic names to agents for easier discovery.",
