,0.01681368239223957,0.014670861884951591,0.01797311380505562,0.028364185243844986,0.0008664375636726618,0.007820919156074524,0.004676633048802614,0.013892444781959057,0.012569858692586422,-0.00036524372990243137,-0.02865065447986126,-0.021525433287024498,0.008280819281935692,-0.030881859362125397,-0.009432493709027767,-0.019532814621925354,-0.007620177697390318,0.02329060062766075,0.03262937441468239,-0.01058154460042715,Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Design Pattern,"Generative models often lack access to up-to-date or specific external knowledge, leading to hallucinations or less accurate/contextualized outputs.","Particularly for generative models, where there's a need to integrate external, up-to-date, or specific knowledge into generative outputs to enhance relevance and quality.","Combines retrieval-based methods with generative modeling. It involves three steps: 1) Retrieve relevant information from a knowledge base, 2) Augment the retrieved data by summarizing and integrating supplementary information, and 3) Generate coherent and contextually appropriate output using advanced machine learning models (e.g., GPT).","Creation of highly accurate, context-aware solutions; improved accuracy, rich contextualization, and flexibility in various AI-driven applications. Outputs are contextually relevant and accurate, addressing specific user needs effectively.","Customer support (personalized, accurate responses), content creation (generating articles, reports, summaries with up-to-date insights), personalized recommendations (e-commerce platforms).",
