356,0.0015500086592510343,0.024898065254092216,0.019784171134233475,0.03432966396212578,0.006920330226421356,0.014700829051434994,-0.00946520920842886,0.0026162327267229557,0.0052020433358848095,-0.011968341656029224,-0.01708296127617359,-0.032460957765579224,0.013960957527160645,-0.00899762474000454,-0.00799588393419981,0.016452621668577194,0.011041059158742428,0.009303885512053967,0.022148219868540764,-0.016171466559171677,Single Agent Architecture,"For simpler, well-defined tasks, the complexity and overhead of a multi-agent system are unnecessary and counterproductive.","A task can be fully accomplished by a single AI agent acting independently, without requiring collaboration or specialized roles from other agents. Examples include basic chatbots or agents performing a single, contained function.","Design the AI system around a single, autonomous agent responsible for all aspects of the task. Frameworks like LangChain are primarily designed for this with examples like a weather query agent.","Simplicity in design and implementation, lower operational overhead, and faster development for tasks that do not require complex coordination or diverse specializations.","Customer support chatbots, simple data query agents, single-purpose automation tasks (e.g., weather query agent).",
