013027099892497063,0.009813384152948856,0.014991571195423603,0.020397815853357315,0.003882786724716425,0.0022829161025583744,-0.016849195584654808,0.0049998159520328045,0.006589272990822792,-0.009104167111217976,-0.01826520636677742,-0.014717727899551392,0.027768630534410477,-0.01842733658850193,-0.003629371291026473,0.002983510261401534,-0.0031918745953589678,0.026240963488817215,0.022171806544065475,-0.019698766991496086,Agentic Reasoning Loop,"How does an AI agent process a request, gather necessary information, make decisions, take actions, and formulate a response in a structured and intelligent manner?","Any agent system (single-agent or multi-agent) that needs to dynamically understand user intent, interact with external tools/data, make decisions, and perform actions. Illustrated with a call center GenAI agent.","The agent follows a cyclical process: 1. Reason and Plan (interpret query, formulate plan). 2. Find Information/Data Intelligence (query external sources). 3. Reason (process info, make decisions, potentially human-in-the-loop). 4. Action (trigger external processes, generate outputs). 5. Reason (formulate response). This loop can iterate.","Enables dynamic, context-aware processing of requests, allowing agents to interact intelligently with their environment and users. Provides a structured approach for complex tasks.","Call center agents, help desk assistants, any task requiring dynamic information retrieval, decision-making, and action.",
