69594336,0.020360257476568222,0.011817785911262035,0.006641916930675507,0.02772011049091816,-0.008742955513298512,0.009487832896411419,0.0012801362900063396,0.010415976867079735,0.0152864009141922,-0.015350054018199444,-0.021179810166358948,-0.0028322148136794567,-0.004526704549789429,-0.016798334196209908,-0.00702667748555541,-0.023815976455807686,-0.012915429659187794,0.017254063859581947,0.027247797697782516,-0.00921272486448288,Transfer Learning,"Training high-accuracy custom ML models on unstructured data (images, text) requires extremely large, labeled datasets, which are often not available for specialized tasks.","Machine learning problems involving unstructured data where a large, generic, pre-trained model exists for a similar task, but the specific target dataset is small.","Take a pre-trained model (trained on a large dataset for a similar task), remove its final output layer, freeze the weights of its intermediate layers (feature extractor), and add new layers specific to the custom task and dataset. Then, train only the new layers (feature extraction) or finetune some of the pre-trained layers.","Enables the development of high-accuracy models on smaller, specialized datasets by leveraging the foundational feature-learning capabilities of large pre-trained models. Reduces training time and data requirements.","Image classification (e.g., medical x-rays, colorectal histology), text classification (e.g., movie review sentiment, patient symptom descriptions), image object detection, machine translation.",
