,0.00806579552590847,0.016233809292316437,0.013882079161703587,0.023471536114811897,0.0023362908978015184,0.001595401088707149,-0.012534555979073048,0.007797201629728079,0.015347346663475037,-0.008123106323182583,-0.016098488122224808,-0.029377393424510956,0.026827478781342506,-0.004079430364072323,-0.013657222501933575,-0.00012308332952670753,0.007372149731963873,0.0034576894249767065,0.020545005798339844,-0.012665647082030773,Stateless Serving Function,"Deploying trained ML models for synchronous, low-latency inference at scale (thousands to millions of requests/second) while ensuring language-agnostic access and easy integration into existing web application frameworks.","Production ML systems requiring real-time, on-demand predictions, where the model needs to be highly scalable, resilient, and easily consumable by diverse client applications.","Export the trained machine learning model into a format (e.g., TensorFlow SavedModel, ONNX) that captures its mathematical core as a stateless function. This function is then deployed into a web application framework (e.g., Cloud Functions, TensorFlow Serving) that provides a REST endpoint.","Enables autoscaling of inference infrastructure, language-neutral access for clients, and leverages existing web application tooling for monitoring, metering, and management. Decouples ML model changes from client applications.","Text classification (movie reviews), logistic regression for baby health prediction.",
