104618,0.012266331352293491,0.004761439748108387,0.015313297510147095,-0.008890744298696518,-0.0026283024344593287,0.00628559198230505,0.00286427466198802,0.00979951024055481,0.005228894297033548,-0.015221210196614265,-0.004974598530679941,-0.0091747110709548,-0.035578567534685135,-0.016289185732603073,-0.018025342375040054,0.007207317277789116,-0.0016780062578618526,0.0377451591193676,-0.0003521210455801338,Bridged Schema,"When an input data provider updates their schema (e.g., adds more granular categories, new features, increased precision), there's insufficient new data to train a new model exclusively, but the new information is valuable.","Machine learning projects where the data schema evolves over time, and it's necessary to combine older data (conforming to an old schema) with newer data (conforming to an improved schema) for model training.","Adapt the older data's schema to match the newer, better data. For categorical features, this can involve transforming old categories into a probabilistic or static representation of the new, more granular categories (e.g., using a priori probabilities). For new features, impute values in the old data.","Allows immediate utilization of valuable new data features while leveraging the larger volume of historical data, improving model accuracy and ensuring the model is trained on the most up-to-date information.","Tip prediction (payment type: cash/card to cash/gift card/debit card/credit card), taxi fare (new features like wiper status), general data precision increases.",
