104013443,0.008991917595267296,0.0030971679370850325,0.0033802692778408527,0.034298285841941833,-0.02295583486557007,-0.0009460742585361004,-0.023511342704296112,0.014696743339300156,0.00520794652402401,-0.005508753005415201,-0.010915976017713547,-0.021389547735452652,-0.0076096816919744015,-0.03922247514128685,-0.000684822560288012,-0.0026890295557677746,-0.0003562497440725565,0.0016018700553104281,0.041375163942575455,-0.02554512396454811,Dynamic Cypher Generation,Cypher Templates are too restrictive; users might ask questions with varying filters or combinations that don't fit a single predefined template.,"Retrieving structured data from a Domain Graph where user questions can have diverse filters and combinations (e.g., 'Which movies did Steven Spielberg direct between 2000 and 2010?').","Snippets of parameterized Cypher queries and their descriptions are made available to an LLM. Given a user question, the LLM decides which snippets to use, extracts parameters from the question, plugs them into the snippets, and combines them to create a full query. The query executes against the database, and the results are provided back to the LLM for answer generation.","More flexible than Cypher Templates, allowing for more diverse user questions to be answered by dynamically constructing queries from reusable components.",Answering natural language questions that require constructing structured queries from reusable components based on user-specified parameters.,
