30032289028,0.018344802781939507,0.014427818357944489,0.015363810583949089,-0.011598076671361923,-0.00037542308564297855,-0.015735356137156487,0.009920733980834484,0.005906442645937204,-0.009168331511318684,-0.03737622871994972,-0.020364977419376373,0.00014513071801047772,-0.03202585130929947,-0.006500979885458946,-0.0019272769568488002,-0.0021888792980462313,0.0027205327060073614,0.036962661892175674,-0.027178173884749413,Local Retriever (GraphRAG),"Answering questions that require localized, entity-specific, or topic-specific context within a large knowledge graph, rather than a global summary or general document chunks.","A combined Lexical Graph and Domain Graph, enriched with extracted entities, relationships, and potentially community structures. The user's query is focused on specific entities or local topics.","Perform an initial vector search, typically on entity embeddings (or embeddings of specific community summaries if a relevant subgraph needs to be identified first). From the identified entities or communities, traverse the graph to retrieve related entities, chunks, or other connected communities. This traversal focuses on gathering information directly relevant to the initial search scope, providing a localized context.","Provides focused, entity-centric or topic-centric context by combining vector search with targeted graph traversal, offering more granular and precise information than global summaries.","Answering questions that require detailed information about specific entities, their immediate connections, or localized topics within a knowledge graph, often as a precursor to more complex reasoning.",
