29566949606,0.007178899832069874,0.031005743891000748,0.014627932570874691,0.02679021656513214,-0.0024212130811065435,0.0016205754363909364,-0.007181168999522924,0.013845258392393589,0.0011230736272409558,-0.009974195621907711,-0.024551594629883766,-0.019369512796401978,0.0032422905787825584,-0.021988818421959877,-0.008115999400615692,0.00452784076333046,0.016343282535672188,0.008522833697497845,0.03865736722946167,-0.019147679209709167,Direct Prompting,"LLMs are constrained by their training data (not aware of recent/specific information, context). They can also exhibit undesirable behaviors like hallucination, overconfidence, or susceptibility to malicious prompts, potentially divulging confidential information or giving misleading replies.","The most basic approach to using an LLM involves connecting an off-the-shelf LLM directly to a user, allowing direct interaction without intermediate steps. While useful for general purposes and initial exploration, this approach has significant shortcomings for production systems.",Send prompts directly from the user to a Foundation LLM.,"Provides immediate interaction with an LLM. However, for practical applications, it often necessitates additional measures to address its inherent limitations regarding knowledge, context, and behavioral control.",[],
