931,-0.007337893359363079,0.005182776600122452,0.005423237103968859,0.005800681654363871,0.008210206404328346,0.0028360129799693823,0.0016177415382117033,-0.0001436900784028694,0.020547645166516304,0.01626601628959179,-0.018680240958929062,-0.01048074197024107,-0.0063012936152517796,0.026402341201901436,-0.03407502546906471,-0.000798724708147347,0.007423735689371824,0.0072901686653494835,0.022073620930314064,0.015257016755640507,-0.015566072426736355,Build a cold start forecasting model using SageMaker AI DeepAR,Accurately forecasting demand or other time-series data for new products or services (the 'cold start' problem) where historical data is scarce or non-existent.,"Businesses need to make predictions for items or events with limited or no historical data, which is a significant challenge in traditional time-series forecasting.","The pattern leverages Amazon SageMaker DeepAR, a machine learning algorithm specifically designed for probabilistic forecasting, to build models that can effectively handle cold start scenarios by learning from similar items or hierarchical data.","Improved forecasting accuracy for cold start items, leading to better inventory management, resource allocation, business planning, and reduced risks associated with new product launches.","Demand forecasting for new products, resource planning for new services, inventory management, financial forecasting for new ventures.",
