76147919893265,-0.001153857447206974,0.01515014935284853,0.007536206394433975,0.031110547482967377,0.00460175983607769,0.010215780697762966,-0.015469265170395374,0.018610550090670586,0.02717096544802189,0.01551361009478569,-0.01893601566553116,-0.031763918697834015,-0.0008972608484327793,-0.014382042922079563,-0.011633876711130142,-0.007785093039274216,0.007799075450748205,0.011792619712650776,0.030035385861992836,0.005751011427491903,Deploy realtime coding security validation with Kiro,"Identifying and remediating security vulnerabilities in code during development, before deployment, to prevent security breaches and reduce the cost of fixing issues later in the lifecycle.","Developers need immediate feedback on security issues in their code. Traditional security scans can be slow and occur late in the development cycle, making remediation more costly and time-consuming.","The pattern integrates Kiro (a tool, likely AI-powered for static analysis or code review) into the development workflow to provide real-time security validation, flagging vulnerabilities as code is written or committed.","Improved code security, reduced vulnerabilities, and faster development cycles by catching and addressing security issues early in the software development lifecycle.","Secure software development, DevSecOps, real-time vulnerability detection, automated code review.",
