81895113,0.0014458241639658809,0.025587212294340134,-0.004325564950704575,0.009657632559537888,0.0011243479093536735,0.024757152423262596,0.011670597828924656,0.0009367195307277143,-0.0164894238114357,-0.01057916134595871,0.0098257502540946,-0.02674674242734909,-0.004997593350708485,-0.0004748106293845922,-0.0008702101185917854,0.010039919055998325,0.023597583174705505,-0.022293822839856148,Develop a chat-based assistant using Amazon Bedrock,Building conversational AI applications quickly and efficiently using powerful foundational models without managing underlying infrastructure.,"Organizations want to leverage the power of Large Language Models (LLMs) to create interactive chat experiences for various purposes (customer service, internal tools, content creation) but need a managed service to access these models.","The pattern outlines how to use Amazon Bedrock, a service that provides access to various foundational models, to develop a chat-based assistant. This typically involves prompt engineering, managing conversation history, and integrating with other AWS services.","A functional and scalable chat-based AI assistant built on powerful foundational models, enabling natural language interaction and rapid deployment of conversational AI solutions.","Chatbots, virtual assistants, interactive Q&A systems, customer service automation.",
