8,0.0024037526454776525,-0.005834036041051149,0.015638988465070724,0.0018525517079979181,-0.0026679623406380415,-0.004474496003240347,-0.00012163517385488376,0.01492229476571083,0.0006342082051560283,-0.01286577433347702,-0.011409507133066654,0.020227963104844093,-0.032013289630413055,0.002108990680426359,-0.016326207667589188,0.00490707578137517,0.01359128300100565,0.03341476991772652,-0.008286046795547009,Use SageMaker Processing for distributed feature engineering of terabyte-scale ML datasets,Performing large-scale feature engineering and data transformations on massive datasets (terabytes) efficiently and scalably for machine learning models.,"Preparing data for ML models often involves complex transformations and feature engineering. For very large datasets, this requires distributed processing capabilities that can handle the volume and complexity.","The pattern leverages Amazon SageMaker Processing, a managed service for data processing, to perform distributed feature engineering tasks on terabyte-scale datasets. This involves defining processing jobs and utilizing scalable compute resources without managing infrastructure.","Scalable and efficient feature engineering for large ML datasets, enabling the development of models on comprehensive data, reducing data preparation time, and improving model performance.","Large-scale data preprocessing, feature engineering, data transformation for ML, big data analytics for ML.",
