08198975026608,-0.0015493622049689293,0.016249576583504677,0.0025734028313308954,0.024433227255940437,0.0001566288119647652,0.01397330965846777,-0.0067321197129786015,0.012517184019088745,0.008294353261590004,-0.0022129283752292395,-0.020895011723041534,-0.011997420340776443,0.026488281786441803,-0.021407373249530792,-0.013940693810582161,0.005392678081989288,0.007509441580623388,0.0016081372741609812,0.029133474454283714,-0.019095994532108307,Deploy agentic systems on Amazon Bedrock with CrewAI,"Building complex, multi-agent AI systems that can collaborate to solve problems or automate workflows that require multiple steps, roles, and tools.","Many real-world problems require more than a single LLM call; they need multiple AI agents with distinct roles, tools, and communication capabilities to achieve a goal, mimicking human team collaboration.","The pattern describes how to deploy agentic systems using Amazon Bedrock (for foundational models) and CrewAI (a framework for orchestrating multi-agent workflows). This involves defining agents, tasks, and a hierarchical or collaborative structure for their interaction.","Sophisticated AI systems capable of tackling complex problems through coordinated efforts of multiple specialized agents, automating multi-step processes, and improving the robustness and capability of AI solutions.","Complex workflow automation, autonomous problem-solving, intelligent process orchestration, AI-driven decision making, multi-agent simulations.",
