012613,0.017128104344010353,0.012072510085999966,0.01644466631114483,0.01832067221403122,-0.007019772659987211,-0.005778896156698465,-0.010949976742267609,0.018924284726381302,0.007411350030452013,-0.00257144239731133,-0.0053253090009093285,-0.02310406230390072,0.030539026483893394,-0.022990455850958824,-0.006585481110960245,0.0005118721164762974,-0.00649234838783741,0.00901312567293644,0.02793732099235058,-0.003682383568957448,Accelerate MLOps with Backstage and self-service Amazon SageMaker AI templates,"Data scientists and ML engineers often face friction and delays in setting up standardized ML development environments and deploying models due to manual configuration, lack of self-service capabilities, and inconsistent tooling.","Organizations need to scale their ML initiatives, requiring efficient onboarding of ML projects, standardized infrastructure provisioning, and streamlined deployment processes. Self-service platforms can empower ML teams while maintaining governance.","The pattern integrates Backstage (an open-source developer portal) with Amazon SageMaker AI templates to provide a self-service portal. This allows ML teams to quickly provision standardized SageMaker environments, MLOps pipelines, and other ML resources through pre-defined templates, accelerating project initiation and deployment.","Faster onboarding of ML projects, increased developer productivity, standardized ML infrastructure, improved governance, and reduced operational overhead for MLOps.","Self-service ML platform, standardized ML environment provisioning, MLOps automation, developer portal for ML teams, accelerating ML project initiation.",
