90087431669,-0.0011354901362210512,0.017566200345754623,0.015019077807664871,0.026029298081994057,0.03466501459479332,-0.0053756446577608585,0.0021434249356389046,-0.0059530725702643394,0.013521000742912292,0.010040980763733387,-0.004893208853900433,-0.021654309704899788,-0.011235157027840614,0.005175319034606218,-0.026544347405433655,-0.010422030463814735,-0.011319708079099655,-0.020238641649484634,0.02201431803405285,0.028023196384310722,-0.013499842025339603,Advanced Generative AI Chat Assistant with RAG and ReAct,"How to build highly capable and context-aware generative AI chat assistants that can reason, retrieve external information, and perform multi-step tasks, overcoming the limitations of basic LLM prompts.","Creating sophisticated conversational AI applications that require more than just direct LLM responses, such as answering complex questions, summarizing documents, or interacting with external tools.","Combine Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) for accessing external knowledge with ReAct (Reasoning and Acting) prompting techniques. RAG allows the LLM to fetch relevant information, while ReAct enables the LLM to reason about a task, plan steps, and execute actions (e.g., tool calls) based on its reasoning.","Highly intelligent and versatile chat assistants capable of providing accurate, up-to-date, and actionable responses by integrating external knowledge and complex reasoning capabilities.",Building enterprise-grade chatbots; intelligent virtual assistants; research assistants; automated customer support systems.,
