516457080841064,0.011950679123401642,0.014561271294951439,0.017466148361563683,0.010608402080833912,-0.005497833713889122,-0.01344391517341137,0.01124508585780859,0.012464934960007668,0.002724658465012908,-0.025928469374775887,-0.03260403871536255,0.014981893822550774,-0.010710030794143677,-0.00024378429225180298,-0.010166676715016365,0.005504066590219736,0.015999337658286095,0.03055592067539692,-0.0077732461504638195,ML Inference Pipeline,"Deploying complex machine learning models that require multiple sequential processing steps (e.g., data preprocessing, model inference, postprocessing) into a single, unified, and scalable endpoint.","When an ML model needs to be served in production, and the inference process involves more than just the model prediction itself, requiring data transformations before or after the core model inference.","Multiple pipeline model objects, representing different ML workflow stages (preprocessing, model inference, postprocessing), are deployed serially behind a single endpoint. This allows the entire sequence of operations to be invoked with a single API call.","Simplifies deployment and invocation of multi-stage ML models, reduces operational overhead, and provides a unified interface for clients.","Real-time prediction services, batch inference jobs where data preparation is integral to the model's input.",
