813211858273,-0.010114768519997597,0.011597730219364166,0.01673153229057789,-0.0031832822132855654,0.03136209771037102,-0.005032774526625872,-0.007672440260648727,0.008305329829454422,0.023361720144748688,0.008096695877611637,-0.0029619180131703615,-0.011779183521866798,-0.01338727492839098,0.005339114461094141,-0.041720084846019745,0.007770398631691933,-0.01101265661418438,0.00481391791254282,0.0005654412088915706,0.028980499133467674,-0.029246879741549492,LLM-to-SQL (Database Query Service),"Users want to query structured databases using natural language, but traditional methods require knowledge of SQL or specific query interfaces. LLMs need a way to accurately translate natural language questions into executable SQL queries.","When a chat-based assistant needs to retrieve specific, structured data from a database (e.g., pricing data, product information) in response to a natural language query.","An LLM is provided with database metadata (schema, table names, column names) and potentially sample rows from relevant tables. The LLM then converts the natural language input query into a structured SQL query. This SQL query is executed against the database, and the query results are then summarized by the LLM to provide a natural language response to the user.","Enables natural language interaction with structured databases, making data retrieval accessible to non-technical users and integrating database insights into conversational AI experiences.","Business intelligence chatbots, data exploration tools, conversational interfaces for enterprise data.",
