2092169038951397,0.009320826269686222,0.0355733186006546,-0.008652226068079472,0.014574980363249779,-0.005843671504408121,0.014436799101531506,0.018980080261826515,-0.00048106812755577266,-0.01626477763056755,-0.02051781304180622,0.02534792199730873,-0.027219215407967567,-0.007977034896612167,0.01054484024643898,-0.016453253105282784,0.0011530310148373246,0.016445191577076912,-0.021016335114836693,Agentic AI for Complex Task Orchestration,"Answering intricate user queries often requires synthesizing information from multiple, diverse sources (e.g., documentation, structured databases) and breaking down complex tasks into simpler, manageable steps. Traditional chatbots or single-purpose LLM calls struggle with this orchestration.",When building advanced chat-based assistants that need to provide comprehensive answers by combining insights from various data sources and executing a sequence of actions or tool calls based on a complex user request.,"An autonomous agent (e.g., 'Agents for Amazon Bedrock') is designed to understand complex tasks and break them down into simpler sub-tasks. The agent orchestrates the execution of these sub-tasks, potentially by invoking different tools or services (e.g., RAG Retrieval service for documentation, Database Query service for structured data). It then synthesizes the retrieved information and results from these actions to generate a thorough and exhaustive final answer.","Enables chat-based assistants to handle highly complex, multi-faceted queries, providing more comprehensive and accurate responses by intelligently combining information from disparate sources and orchestrating multiple AI capabilities.","Enterprise knowledge assistants, advanced customer support bots, research assistants, complex decision support systems.",
