612923927605152,0.007797709200531244,0.015896325930953026,0.007158311083912849,0.027801180258393288,0.0044916835613548756,0.005927767138928175,0.0010821811156347394,0.013128358870744705,0.016599755734205246,-0.00019930637790821493,-0.008803977631032467,-0.014707399532198906,-0.0012567294761538506,-0.021334566175937653,-0.009457172825932503,-0.0013404787750914693,-0.0014425641857087612,0.0018069419311359525,0.03404231369495392,-0.015501530840992928,Voice-to-Knowledge Capture Workflow,"Institutional knowledge, often tacit and shared informally through conversations, is difficult to capture, document, and preserve systematically, leading to loss of valuable insights when employees leave or as time passes.","Organizations need to formalize and document informal knowledge (e.g., best practices, solutions to intricate problems, insights from senior employees) that exists in voice recordings or spoken interactions.","A serverless workflow orchestrates several AI-powered steps: 1. **Transcribe**: Uses Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) (e.g., Amazon Transcribe) to convert audio files into text transcripts. 2. **Validate**: Uses an LLM (e.g., via Amazon Bedrock) to analyze transcripts, determine relevance, and separate on-topic from off-topic responses. 3. **Summarize**: Uses an LLM (e.g., via Amazon Bedrock) to generate coherent and concise summaries of the on-topic answers. 4. **Generate**: Assembles the summaries into a well-structured document.","Systematically captures, documents, and verifies institutional knowledge from voice inputs, preserving valuable insights, fostering innovation, enhancing decision-making, and accelerating learning curves for new employees.","Corporate training, knowledge management, historical record keeping, expert system development.",
