,0.011100090108811855,0.011683634482324123,0.006555517204105854,0.0027691577561199665,0.006834522355347872,0.006550926715135574,-0.008170351386070251,0.012563217431306839,0.010377153754234314,0.005428793840110302,-0.018245752900838852,-0.021772246807813644,0.02283594198524952,-0.03134366124868393,-0.00709974579513073,-0.005138817243278027,-0.010922922752797604,0.016218017786741257,0.028814930468797684,-0.010394793003797531,Streamlined ML Workflows with SageMaker and Hydra,"Managing the complexity of ML experiments, configuration, and scaling from local development to production-grade environments.","Data scientists and ML engineers need a consistent and reproducible way to develop, train, and experiment with ML models, easily transitioning from local machines to scalable cloud infrastructure.","Combine Amazon SageMaker's capabilities for scalable ML training and experimentation with Hydra, a configuration management framework, to manage experiment configurations, parameters, and data. This allows for reproducible and scalable ML workflows.","Accelerated ML development cycles, improved reproducibility of experiments, easier scaling of training jobs, and better management of complex ML project configurations.","Managing hyperparameter tuning, running multiple experiments with different configurations, ensuring reproducibility of research, scaling ML training to large datasets and models.",
