015,0.013510013930499554,0.0005324194789864123,0.01723993755877018,0.014754507690668106,0.026611316949129105,0.03205578401684761,-0.004350476432591677,0.009708300232887268,0.0008270235848613083,0.02133612520992756,0.00849790871143341,-0.0007500840583816171,-0.019653581082820892,-0.013211916200816631,0.006396017968654633,-0.027621762827038765,-0.01143385749310255,-0.006368106231093407,-0.015060970559716225,0.024385713040828705,0.024669062346220016,-0.012943641282618046,Develop advanced generative AI chat-based assistants by using RAG and ReAct prompting,"Building generative AI chat-based assistants that require factual accuracy, access to up-to-date external information, and the ability to perform complex, multi-step reasoning and actions.","When developing conversational AI systems, particularly those powered by Large Language Models (LLMs), where the inherent knowledge of the LLM might be insufficient or outdated, and the application needs to interact with external systems or perform logical sequences of operations.","Implement a system that combines Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) with ReAct (Reasoning and Acting) prompting. RAG involves retrieving relevant information from an external knowledge base (e.g., vector database, document store) based on the user's query and then feeding this retrieved context to the LLM for response generation. ReAct prompting structures the LLM's interaction by interleaving 'Thought' (reasoning) and 'Action' (tool use or information retrieval) steps, allowing the LLM to plan, execute, and observe results before generating a final 'Answer.'","The chat-based assistants become more reliable, factually grounded, and capable of handling complex queries and tasks. They can leverage external, real-time data, perform multi-step operations, and provide more coherent and contextually appropriate responses, reducing hallucinations and improving overall utility.","Enterprise chatbots, customer support agents, intelligent personal assistants, research assistants, interactive problem-solving applications, data analysis assistants.",
