15035,0.00808751117438078,0.014843444339931011,0.01748582348227501,0.014188305474817753,-0.007400895468890667,-0.0003277392534073442,-0.0052299764938652515,0.016824455931782722,0.0034957448951900005,-0.003202595515176654,-0.004594247788190842,-0.023944759741425514,0.021203525364398956,-0.015455485321581364,-0.006006660405546427,0.0021039769053459167,-0.0004251647915225476,0.015479647554457188,0.025270838290452957,0.0008719771285541356,Accelerate MLOps with Self-Service AI Templates,"Organizations face significant challenges in scaling, standardizing, and securing ML infrastructure, leading to inconsistent environments, manual provisioning overhead, lack of discoverability/reuse, complex governance, slow time to value, and security risks. Data scientists often struggle to use Infrastructure as Code (IaC) templates directly due to a lack of infrastructure expertise.","An organization with data science teams, ML engineers, platform engineers, and cloud architects needs to streamline the development, deployment, and management of ML workflows. They use AWS and Amazon SageMaker AI.","Combine Backstage (an open-source developer portal) with Amazon SageMaker AI and hardened Infrastructure as Code (IaC) modules. Backstage acts as a self-service platform, allowing data scientists to deploy standardized ML environments without needing to understand the underlying infrastructure details. GitHub Actions automate resource provisioning through SeedFarmer and AWS CDK.","Accelerates time to value for ML initiatives, enforces consistent security and governance, provides data scientists with standardized compliant environments, and reduces operational overhead and infrastructure complexity.","Provisioning SageMaker Studio environments, SageMaker notebooks, custom SageMaker project templates, and model deployment pipelines.",
