037,-0.0025600851513445377,0.004624038469046354,0.011330077424645424,0.012590380385518074,0.017663875594735146,-0.0025865144561976194,-0.00471729040145874,-0.024317659437656403,0.022283054888248444,0.01673162542283535,0.017201418057084084,-0.010512827895581722,-0.013966561295092106,0.008130533620715141,-0.005150333046913147,0.0024797075893729925,-0.010350554250180721,-0.0026910314336419106,0.0026276446878910065,0.022548943758010864,0.0012082434259355068,ChatOps with Amazon Q Developer for SAST Management,"Managing and acting upon Static Application Security Testing (SAST) scan results can be cumbersome, requiring manual review and action, especially in a DevOps context.",DevOps teams using chat applications for operational tasks and needing to integrate SAST result management with AI assistance.,"Implement a ChatOps solution that leverages Amazon Q Developer (an AI assistant) within chat applications. This solution uses custom actions and AWS CloudFormation to deploy and manage the integration, allowing developers to interact with SAST results and potentially get AI-driven insights or actions directly from their chat interface.","Streamlined management of SAST scan results, potentially faster remediation, and improved developer experience by integrating AI assistance into ChatOps workflows.","Managing SAST scan results, querying for vulnerabilities, initiating remediation steps, or getting explanations from the AI assistant directly within chat applications.",
