2447714806,0.018239490687847137,0.0069029079750180244,0.00676797004416585,-0.008653716184198856,-1.7331143681076355e-05,-0.00822079461067915,0.013567031361162663,0.014682228676974773,0.007340207230299711,-0.011887148022651672,-0.006801539566367865,0.026675092056393623,-0.026022545993328094,-0.006796093657612801,-0.007308114320039749,0.014460462145507336,0.02025526575744152,0.04008481651544571,-0.005544225685298443,SageMaker AI Studio Classic Integration,"Integrating source code repositories (e.g., AWS CodeCommit) with an AI development environment (Amazon SageMaker AI Studio Classic) across different AWS accounts can be complex, hindering collaborative and secure ML development.",Organizations with distributed ML teams or strict security requirements that necessitate managing source code in a separate AWS account from their Amazon SageMaker AI Studio Classic development environment.,"The pattern involves associating an AWS CodeCommit repository located in one AWS account with an Amazon SageMaker AI Studio Classic instance in another AWS account. (Specific implementation details are not provided in the text, but the pattern name implies the solution).","Enables ML developers working in SageMaker AI Studio Classic to seamlessly access and version control their code from a centralized or secure AWS CodeCommit repository, fostering collaboration and adherence to security policies.","Setting up secure and collaborative ML development environments, integrating source control with ML workspaces, facilitating cross-team or cross-project ML development.",
