10927751660347,0.01573774591088295,0.01763996109366417,0.028613995760679245,-0.0001809870300348848,0.019032210111618042,-0.0007097858469933271,0.012727157212793827,0.024048730731010437,-0.004094433970749378,-0.011499064043164253,-0.029600240290164948,0.013624973595142365,-0.03598484396934509,-0.005922799464315176,0.0034932848066091537,0.001720069209113717,0.002848206553608179,0.014463890343904495,-0.01842368021607399,AIML Model Result Visualization,"Presenting the outputs, predictions, or insights from AI/ML models to end-users or stakeholders in an accessible, interactive, and scalable web interface.","After developing and deploying AI/ML models, there is a critical need to communicate their results effectively. This often involves building a web application to display visualizations, dashboards, or interactive prediction interfaces.",The pattern involves creating a web application using Flask (a Python web framework) to visualize AI/ML model results and deploying this application on AWS Elastic Beanstalk for managed scalability and ease of deployment.,"Provides a robust, scalable, and user-friendly web platform for showcasing AI/ML model outputs, making complex insights digestible and actionable for various audiences.","Building interactive dashboards for model performance, creating web interfaces for real-time model predictions, developing data exploration tools for ML outputs, and communicating AI insights to business users.",
