442116,0.011046732775866985,0.014494958333671093,0.002118585631251335,0.03332745283842087,-0.011061074212193489,-0.013513626530766487,0.006682015955448151,0.021854691207408905,0.012727693654596806,0.009841646067798138,0.006117604672908783,-0.005424431059509516,0.017073946073651314,-0.05736129730939865,0.0026780443731695414,-0.00618215836584568,-0.008526112884283066,-0.0142898578196764,0.02739131450653076,-0.02235078252851963,AI-Assisted Data Insight Generation,"Extracting meaningful data insights from complex, potentially legacy, datasets can be challenging and time-consuming, especially for users who may not be proficient in complex query languages or traditional business intelligence tools.","An organization has modernized data from legacy systems (e.g., mainframes) using services like AWS Mainframe Modernization, making it available for analysis. A business intelligence platform (e.g., QuickSight) is in use, and there's a need to empower users to generate insights more efficiently.","Integrate an AI assistant (such as Amazon Q) directly into the business intelligence platform. This AI assistant allows users to interact with the data using natural language queries, which the AI then processes to generate relevant data insights, reports, or visualizations.","Users can more easily and quickly derive insights from their data, reducing the barrier to entry for data analysis and accelerating decision-making, particularly when dealing with modernized legacy data.","Business intelligence, data exploration, reporting, self-service analytics",
