86375325918,0.013429776765406132,6.344410212477669e-05,0.005935291759669781,0.0003391623613424599,0.01094868965446949,-0.01643206737935543,0.024831848219037056,0.0005922058480791748,0.01882210001349449,-0.01882302388548851,-0.004982626996934414,0.025342077016830444,-0.019763324409723282,-0.012818422168493271,-0.005771736614406109,-0.01074723619967699,-0.014517933130264282,0.026113145053386688,-0.0070111132226884365,Application Migration Segmentation and Recommendation,"Organizations need an efficient and automated way to assess application readiness for cloud migration, determine optimal migration strategies, and identify suitable cloud services from a large portfolio.","A large portfolio of applications exists, each with unique technical characteristics, source code, and business impact. Manual assessment for cloud migration is time-consuming and prone to inconsistencies. The goal is to generate actionable recommendations for migration paths (e.g., Rehost, Refactor, Rearchitect, Rebuild, Retire) and target cloud services.","Implement an intelligent system that automatically segments applications into recommended migration categories and identifies potential cloud services. This system analyzes various factors including source code analysis, cloud readiness scores, software resiliency, and business impact data collected through surveys. The segmentation and recommendations are generated based on these characteristics.","Provides clear, data-driven recommendations for application migration strategies and suitable AWS services, enabling organizations to plan and develop a portfolio roadmap for cloud migration more effectively and consistently.","Cloud migration planning, application portfolio management, automated assessment and advisory systems, strategic IT planning.",
