1033612638712,0.0025358356069773436,0.00505444360896945,0.005232647061347961,0.009256894700229168,0.018932294100522995,0.00951095949858427,0.021350136026740074,0.0012963274493813515,0.015323544852435589,0.011967374011874199,0.006197373848408461,-0.0022493053693324327,-0.01696810871362686,0.01137452106922865,-0.01596130058169365,-0.021025415509939194,-0.010090652853250504,-0.002656094031408429,0.005450471304357052,0.03836537525057793,0.0036746514961123466,AI-Assisted Infrastructure as Code (IaC) Generation,"Manually creating and maintaining Infrastructure as Code (IaC) templates for deploying modernized applications can be complex, time-consuming, and error-prone, especially when dealing with new architectures or cloud services.","After refactoring a legacy application to a modern cloud-native architecture, there is a need to quickly and accurately provision the necessary cloud infrastructure (compute, database, storage, security) to support the new application.","An AI system, accessible via a chat interface, can generate sample Infrastructure as Code (IaC) templates (e.g., AWS CloudFormation, AWS CDK, Hashicorp Terraform) tailored to deploy the core components of the refactored application. Users can request these templates through natural language prompts.","Accelerated deployment of modernized applications by providing ready-to-use or easily adaptable IaC templates, reducing manual configuration effort and potential deployment errors.","Cloud infrastructure provisioning, automated deployment, accelerating DevOps workflows for modernized applications.",
