50304353237,-0.005506819114089012,-0.012591020204126835,0.0019077365286648273,-0.131525918841362,-0.0007739703287370503,-0.0034616042394191027,0.008084531873464584,0.01537091750651598,0.015897341072559357,-0.008933001197874546,-0.034044887870550156,-0.01047393400222063,-0.02164474129676819,0.03369023650884628,-0.032389841973781586,-0.013483596034348011,-0.014922929927706718,0.01898128166794777,0.1276402622461319,-0.01253653597086668,-0.01348514948040247,0.01058950088918209,-0.022391751408576965,0.005743107292801142,-0.02814893238246441,-0.019473761320114136,0.004432970657944679,0.0006525477510876954,-0.0014806671533733606,0.011606855317950249,0.00153232307638973,0.000554058700799942,0.006994768511503935,0.027477947995066643,0.003154348349198699,-0.006873125210404396,0.009276003576815128,-0.006913743447512388,0.010139141231775284,0.009658501483500004,0.00937799084931612,-0.0026718147564679384,0.021673019975423813,0.02179602161049843,0.019744496792554855,0.02508578449487686,0.008944873698055744,0.025293981656432152,0.015620472840964794,0.03537619113922119,0.013489479199051857,-0.010709288530051708,-0.03973519057035446,-0.0011928025633096695,-0.09016221016645432,0.023537851870059967,0.00797182321548462,0.015276509337127209,0.014475175179541111,-0.020641647279262543,-0.0014485801802948117,0.03128154203295708,0.016752200201153755,0.012873421423137188,-0.026058360934257507,0.00902607198804617,0.018664196133613586,-0.005504176020622253,-0.0010130625450983644,0.02437712252140045,0.013221480883657932,0.005434800870716572,-0.007287750020623207,0.0064302412793040276,0.03945442661643028,-0.01473570242524147,0.008058346807956696,-0.005780178587883711,-0.023161767050623894,0.028495823964476585,0.0010224980069324374,0.03615133464336395,-0.021710049360990524,0.008296852931380272,-0.014799545519053936,-0.014322695322334766,-0.007483178749680519,-0.008813186548650265,-0.03901103883981705,0.006636335980147123,0.0009158212342299521,-0.014135224744677544,-0.01022971048951149,-0.004612572491168976,0.019223863258957863,-0.016058538109064102,0.004770214203745127,0.012698890641331673,-0.007167516276240349,-0.010202040895819664,0.013691443018615246,0.014800429344177246,0.013162248767912388,-0.00251783337444067,-0.0076599097810685635,0.0010776640847325325,-0.04101458936929703,0.0017283891793340445,-0.007837779819965363,0.00964939035475254,-0.0021102209575474262,0.021767452359199524,-0.0009483195026405156,Sensitive Data Discovery and Isolation,"CloudWatch Logs often contain application data that can inadvertently include sensitive user information (PII, financial data), creating compliance and security risks. Traditional log monitoring approaches lack automated sensitive data detection capabilities, making it difficult to identify and respond to potential data exposures in real-time.","Organizations need to monitor logs for sensitive data to maintain data confidentiality, ensure compliance, and enable proactive incident response. This is particularly relevant for applications generating large volumes of logs that might contain PII or financial data.","A comprehensive security monitoring workflow is implemented. CloudWatch Logs entries are streamed to an Amazon S3 bucket via Amazon Data Firehose. Amazon Macie is configured to periodically scan this S3 bucket for sensitive data (PII, financial data, etc.), potentially using custom data identifiers. If Macie identifies sensitive data, an EventBridge rule triggers a Lambda function. This Lambda function removes the sensitive log from the original S3 bucket, encrypts it, and isolates it in a separate, secure data isolation S3 bucket. Simultaneously, an Amazon SNS topic is initiated to send email notifications to configured recipients, alerting them about the sensitive data finding.","Automated detection and alerting for sensitive data in logging systems, enabling proactive incident response. Sensitive data is automatically isolated to a secure S3 bucket, enhancing data confidentiality and compliance. Security teams and compliance officers gain visibility into data security risks and can respond efficiently.","Security teams and compliance officers to maintain data confidentiality, identify and respond to potential data exposures in real-time, and integrate with existing security operations processes.",
