0.006230475846678019,-0.0012930802768096328,0.008166036568582058,0.013546781614422798,0.014661037363111973,-0.00026080154930241406,0.001267837593331933,-0.02118166908621788,0.021240003407001495,0.01940961927175522,0.015951093286275864,-0.007149422541260719,-0.01723855547606945,0.010647187940776348,-0.01363720465451479,0.00826653465628624,-0.009073231369256973,-0.0006200242787599564,0.006798929069191217,0.016502192243933678,0.003112359205260873,AI-Powered ChatOps for SAST Result Management,"Managing and acting upon Static Application Security Testing (SAST) scan results can be a manual, time-consuming process, often requiring developers to leave their communication tools. There's a need for a more integrated, automated, and conversational way to handle security findings.","Development teams use chat applications for communication and collaboration. They want to integrate security operations, specifically SAST result management, directly into their chat workflows to streamline remediation and improve developer experience, leveraging AI for intelligent interaction and automation.","Deploy a ChatOps solution that integrates Amazon Q Developer with chat applications and custom actions. Amazon Q Developer acts as an AI assistant within the chat, allowing users to query, summarize, and potentially trigger actions related to SAST scan results directly from the chat interface. Custom actions and CloudFormation define the integration points and automation workflows.","Streamlined management of SAST scan results, improved developer productivity by keeping them in their chat environment, faster response to security findings, and AI-driven insights and actions.","Conversational querying and summarization of SAST scan results, triggering automated remediation or ticketing actions for security findings from chat, integrating security operations into developer chat workflows.",
