43311047554,-0.012407739646732807,0.0023753743153065443,0.01575342006981373,0.008338198065757751,0.04237090423703194,0.011924889869987965,0.016115982085466385,-0.018068283796310425,0.02261476404964924,0.03156573697924614,0.017324551939964294,-0.015431530773639679,-0.02507345750927925,0.005880232434719801,-0.015469400212168694,-0.015380636788904667,-0.0058284723199903965,0.006534370128065348,0.011304710060358047,0.02016078308224678,-0.001422368222847581,Real-time AI-Powered Coding Security Validation,"Developers need immediate feedback on security vulnerabilities or best practice violations as they write code, rather than waiting for later stages like SAST scans or code reviews. Integrating security validation directly into the coding environment is crucial for shifting left on security.","Development teams are using various coding assistants (AI-powered tools that help with code generation, completion, and analysis). They want to extend these assistants to provide real-time security validation, identifying potential issues as code is being written.",Deploy a system involving an MCP server with Kiro and other 'coding assistants' to enable real-time analysis of code for security vulnerabilities and best practice adherence. This provides immediate feedback to the developer within their IDE or coding environment as code is being written.,"Proactive identification and remediation of security issues during code development, improved code quality, reduced security debt, and enhanced developer productivity.","Real-time security vulnerability detection during coding, enforcing coding security best practices, integrating security analysis directly into developer workflows.",
