28926992416,0.00013436173321679235,0.017602860927581787,0.01589108258485794,0.006079814396798611,0.016817668452858925,-0.00837394967675209,0.005545664578676224,-0.0067114876583218575,0.012250831350684166,0.018844470381736755,-0.002967691980302334,-0.021821189671754837,-0.01766730472445488,-0.01239079050719738,-0.029581524431705475,0.004862960893660784,-0.014523137360811234,0.0005163243040442467,-0.00011805236135842279,0.023639503866434097,-0.012555827386677265,Layout-Aware Multimodal Data Extraction and Chunking,"Accurately extracting and chunking information from complex multimodal documents (e.g., PDFs with text, images, tables) while preserving crucial contextual and structural relationships, which are often lost with simple text extraction or basic parsing.","Building a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline for documents where the spatial layout and semantic relationships between different modalities (text, images, tables) are critical for the LLM's understanding and for effective retrieval.","Utilize advanced extraction techniques that employ 'finely tuned layout aware models' and Natural Language Processing (NLP) to interpret the document's visual and semantic structure. This model-based approach performs 'semantic chunking,' ensuring that related data elements (e.g., table content, its descriptive text, image captions) are grouped together within chunks, respecting their original context and layout.","Generates higher-quality, contextually rich chunks that accurately reflect the document's original meaning and structure. This leads to more relevant retrieval results and significantly improves the LLM's ability to comprehend and reason over the provided context, enhancing the overall performance of the multimodal RAG system.","Processing legal documents, technical manuals, research papers, or building codes that combine text, tables, and diagrams, where the spatial arrangement of these elements conveys critical information; ensuring that tabular data is chunked with its surrounding explanatory text.",
