5,0.02635999210178852,0.015936333686113358,0.017181966453790665,0.027073172852396965,-0.005887953098863363,0.010098862461745739,-0.009677269496023655,0.004697632975876331,0.002401745645329356,-0.008282330818474293,-0.02622920088469982,-0.015862947329878807,0.017507340759038925,-0.02291913330554962,-0.016487881541252136,-0.0037996708415448666,-0.005556696094572544,0.004687037318944931,0.031605057418346405,-0.021034475415945053,Agentic Corrective RAG,"Traditional RAG systems often retrieve irrelevant or ambiguous documents, leading to errors, inconsistencies, or hallucinations in generated responses.","RAG systems where high response accuracy and factuality are critical, requiring iterative refinement of retrieved context and generated responses.","Embed intelligent agents into the RAG workflow to dynamically evaluate retrieved documents for relevance (Relevance Evaluation Agent), refine queries (Query Refinement Agent), perform external knowledge retrieval when context is insufficient (External Knowledge Retrieval Agent), and synthesize validated information (Response Synthesis Agent). This forms an iterative self-correction loop.","High response accuracy, minimized errors and hallucinations, dynamic adaptability through query refinement and real-time web searches, and efficient operation due to agentic modularity.","Academic research assistants (latest findings), any application requiring high factuality and iterative improvement of RAG outputs.",
