8,0.016921091824769974,0.011641031131148338,0.01681920327246189,0.024399811401963234,-0.017321355640888214,0.002618810161948204,-0.01518434938043356,0.00878459494560957,0.0010622140252962708,-0.004961234517395496,-0.02303299680352211,-0.024190666154026985,0.004627799149602652,-0.03700542449951172,-0.004413656424731016,-0.00031445262720808387,-0.005681435111910105,0.007592904847115278,0.032671008259058,-0.01943686418235302,GeAR (Graph-Enhanced Agent for Retrieval-Augmented Generation),"Traditional RAG systems struggle with multi-hop retrieval scenarios and capturing complex relationships between entities, leading to incomplete or inaccurate answers for complex queries.",RAG systems needing to enhance multi-hop retrieval and reasoning by leveraging graph-structured data and dynamic agent-based decision-making.,"Incorporate a Graph Expansion Module that integrates graph-based data into the retrieval process, expanding the search space to include connected entities. An Agent-Based Retrieval framework dynamically selects and combines retrieval strategies, autonomously deciding to utilize graph-expanded paths. The LLM then synthesizes this enriched information.","Enhanced multi-hop retrieval, agentic decision-making for dynamic strategy selection, improved accuracy by incorporating structured graph data, and scalability.","Multi-hop question answering (e.g., 'Which author influenced the mentor of JK Rowling'), complex relational queries.",
