67026048899,-0.0013874830910935998,0.013678793795406818,0.023063423112034798,0.007882580161094666,0.03309972211718559,-0.0024323833640664816,0.006228040438145399,-0.01503679621964693,0.009086749516427517,0.0077812764793634415,-0.013613510876893997,-0.0302913598716259,-0.015046492218971252,0.013657941482961178,-0.023794397711753845,-0.010449430905282497,0.0008021524408832192,0.002281534718349576,0.002440923359245062,0.02392292581498623,-0.02120721898972988,Agentic Document Workflows (ADW),"Automating complex, document-centric knowledge work (e.g., invoice processing, contract review) requires maintaining state across multi-step processes, applying domain-specific logic, and orchestrating various components beyond simple RAG.","End-to-end knowledge work automation involving document parsing, retrieval, reasoning, and structured output generation, where traditional RAG and IDP fall short in state maintenance and multi-step orchestration.","Orchestrate complex document-centric processes using intelligent agents. This involves: 1) Document Parsing and Information Structuring (extracting data fields), 2) State Maintenance Across Processes (tracking document context), 3) Knowledge Retrieval (from external KBs, vector indexes), 4) Agentic Orchestration (applying business rules, multi-hop reasoning), and 5) Actionable Output Generation (structured reports).","End-to-end automation of document-centric tasks, state maintenance, multi-step orchestration, domain-specific intelligence, scalability, and enhanced productivity.","Invoice payments workflow, contract review, claims analysis, compliance analysis.",
