3422521054745,-0.002575064543634653,0.014779528602957726,0.014813669957220554,0.014385946094989777,0.03265254944562912,-0.0023967225570231676,0.010281773284077644,-0.011305142194032669,0.01148482970893383,0.006375453434884548,-0.006872645113617182,-0.019283868372440338,-0.01647544838488102,0.02036767639219761,-0.023359203711152077,-0.013753945007920265,-0.002043923130258918,-0.01019066572189331,0.013503647409379482,0.026327267289161682,-0.016272785142064095,Agentic Retrieval Augmented Generation (Agentic RAG),"Traditional RAG systems may lack adaptability, context-awareness, and the ability to perform complex, multi-step reasoning or dynamic information retrieval, leading to suboptimal or static responses from LLMs.","Building AI systems that require dynamic information retrieval, complex reasoning, and adaptive behavior, especially with Large Language Models (LLMs) that need to be grounded in external, up-to-date, or specialized knowledge.","Integrate AI agents with Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG). The agent orchestrates the retrieval process, potentially reformulating queries, performing multi-step reasoning, and dynamically interacting with external knowledge sources to provide highly relevant and contextualized information to the LLM for generation. This often involves planning, tool use, and self-correction capabilities within the agent.","Creation of adaptive, context-aware, and impactful solutions; enhanced LLM performance; improved information retrieval; reduced hallucination; ability to handle complex tasks and workflows.","Transformative applications across industries and domains (general), time series analysis, mental health care, digital diagnostics, responsible generative AI in education, document workflows (patient case summary, contract review, auto insurance claims, research paper report generation), ad sales.",
