55386543274,-0.006682594772428274,0.013568451628088951,0.010122631676495075,0.006009060423821211,0.017850270494818687,-0.0009995851432904601,0.01914217695593834,-0.0009518397855572402,0.00955958105623722,-0.007127868011593819,-0.013209131546318531,-0.008217621594667435,-0.011736483313143253,0.0053404271602630615,-0.019495192915201187,-0.01427043229341507,-0.0063759866170585155,-0.015074933879077435,0.02375878021121025,0.042796969413757324,-0.020091837272047997,Self-Refine,"Large Language Models (LLMs) might produce initial outputs that are suboptimal, incomplete, or incorrect, and lack an inherent mechanism to improve them without external human intervention.","Generating high-quality, accurate, and refined outputs from LLMs for complex tasks where an initial draft might not meet the desired standards.","An LLM generates an initial output, then critically evaluates its own output (self-feedback) and iteratively refines it based on this feedback until a satisfactory result is achieved. This often involves the LLM generating a critique or a set of instructions for improvement, and then using that critique to guide a new generation.","Improved quality, accuracy, and completeness of LLM-generated outputs; reduced need for human oversight in the refinement process; enhanced problem-solving capabilities.","Any task where iterative improvement of LLM output is beneficial, such as code generation, creative writing, complex problem-solving, and content creation.",
