0.011774510145187378,0.01016311813145876,0.01147505547851324,0.03024771437048912,0.0013624642742797732,0.02129225991666317,-0.006169334053993225,-0.0014869269216433167,-0.00019266462186351418,-0.003055332228541374,-0.007750682067126036,-0.019452691078186035,0.005516619887202978,-0.02916407771408558,-0.02215534634888172,0.015142271295189857,0.0023931802716106176,0.011271214112639427,0.025058167055249214,-0.014812442474067211,Reflexion,"LLM agents might get stuck in loops, make suboptimal decisions, or fail to learn from past mistakes and experiences in multi-step reasoning or interactive environments, leading to inefficient or incorrect task completion.","Developing robust and adaptive LLM agents that can learn and improve their performance over time, especially in tasks requiring sequential decision-making, long-term planning, or problem-solving where trial and error is involved.","Agents maintain a 'reflection' or 'memory' of past actions, observations, and outcomes. They use verbal reinforcement learning, where the LLM itself generates reflections on its performance, identifies errors, and learns strategies to avoid similar mistakes or improve future actions, guiding subsequent steps.","Enhanced agent robustness, improved decision-making, ability to learn from experience, reduced errors in multi-step tasks, and more efficient goal achievement.","Complex problem-solving, interactive environments, long-running agentic tasks, game playing, and autonomous task execution.",
