.019148100167512894,0.012920355424284935,0.013369408436119556,0.029232341796159744,-0.01517360471189022,0.006103500723838806,-0.010886987671256065,0.011455180123448372,0.004443523474037647,-0.006982129067182541,-0.018548956140875816,-0.014533094130456448,0.00013026631495449692,-0.032984279096126556,-0.0033753891475498676,-0.006289736367762089,-0.00979328528046608,0.007301131263375282,0.03200840577483177,-0.014102729968726635,Adaptive Retrieval Augmented Generation (AdaptiveRAG),"A static or one-size-fits-all retrieval strategy for RAG systems may not be optimal for all queries, as the complexity of a question or task should influence how retrieval is performed.","RAG systems dealing with a wide range of question complexities or information needs, where a fixed retrieval approach might be inefficient, ineffective, or lead to suboptimal LLM responses.","The RAG system learns to adapt its retrieval strategy (e.g., depth of search, number of documents, type of retrieval, query formulation) based on the perceived complexity, type, or confidence of the input question or task. This often involves a meta-learner or an agent that assesses complexity and dynamically adjusts retrieval parameters.","More efficient and effective retrieval, improved generation quality across varying question complexities, optimized resource usage, and enhanced adaptability of RAG systems.","Question answering systems, chatbots, and other LLM applications requiring dynamic and intelligent retrieval strategies tailored to the input.",
