23,0.007508792448788881,0.014139359816908836,0.016090426594018936,0.004776212852448225,0.03266431391239166,-0.005626770667731762,0.003802237333729863,-0.005971129518002272,-0.003281921613961458,0.00918650720268488,-0.0051002902910113335,-0.012757712975144386,-0.024850165471434593,0.012575894594192505,-0.0195021852850914,-0.007701086811721325,0.008828556165099144,-0.006779332645237446,0.006557061802595854,0.02904944308102131,-0.009828082285821438,Multi-Agent Orchestration,"A single LLM agent might be overwhelmed by complex, multi-faceted tasks, lack specialized expertise for different sub-problems, or struggle with coordination in collaborative problem-solving scenarios.","Complex AI tasks that can be naturally decomposed into sub-tasks, requiring different specialized expertise, diverse perspectives, or sequential collaboration among multiple intelligent entities.","Design a system where multiple specialized AI agents (each potentially an LLM agent with specific roles, tools, or knowledge) interact and collaborate to solve a larger problem. An orchestration framework manages their communication, task assignment, workflow execution, and conflict resolution, allowing agents to leverage each other's strengths.","Improved problem-solving for complex tasks, enhanced robustness and scalability, ability to simulate collaborative human workflows, better division of labor, and more sophisticated emergent behaviors.","Autogen (Microsoft), OpenAI Swarm, crewAI, complex simulations, collaborative content generation, software development, research assistance.",
