0.0041137621738016605,0.018370838835835457,0.0037988314870744944,0.030512215569615364,0.0040024518966674805,0.008917804807424545,-0.011142543517053127,-0.00030950605287216604,0.0038946568965911865,-0.014573461376130581,-0.014640946872532368,-0.030541744083166122,0.0207839272916317,-0.0184517540037632,-0.00026756495935842395,0.012756290845572948,0.0014747555833309889,0.005605846177786589,0.02506432496011257,-0.019210126250982285,LLM Agent Planning,"LLMs, by default, are primarily text generators. For complex tasks, agents need to break down problems, sequence actions, select appropriate tools, and anticipate outcomes, which requires explicit planning capabilities beyond simple next-token prediction.","Developing LLM-based agents that can autonomously perform multi-step tasks, achieve specific goals, navigate complex environments, or orchestrate workflows, rather than just responding to single prompts.","Equip the LLM agent with a planning module or integrate planning capabilities directly into the LLM's reasoning process (e.g., using Chain-of-Thought, Tree-of-Thought, or ReAct prompts). This module generates a sequence of steps, sub-goals, or actions to achieve a larger objective, often involving tool selection, condition checking, and iterative refinement of the plan.","Agents can tackle complex, multi-step problems; improved task completion rates; more robust and goal-oriented behavior; and enhanced autonomy in task execution.","Autonomous agents, task automation, complex problem-solving, robotics, workflow orchestration, code generation.",
