2,-0.0019220717949792743,0.012236145325005054,0.01516125537455082,0.011258605867624283,0.02305874042212963,-0.00935648288577795,0.009717832319438457,-0.006371818017214537,0.00986990612000227,0.010168209671974182,-0.011160653084516525,-0.023515719920396805,-0.008261788636446,-0.0021141059696674347,-0.027493109926581383,-0.005745595786720514,-0.007837653160095215,-0.006365653593093157,0.016768470406532288,0.038573265075683594,-0.02393660694360733,Prompt Engineering,"Large Language Models (LLMs) are highly sensitive to the input instructions, and poorly formulated prompts can lead to irrelevant, inaccurate, or unhelpful responses, failing to elicit the desired behavior or output quality.","Interacting with pre-trained LLMs for various tasks, where the goal is to guide the model to produce specific, high-quality, and relevant outputs without fine-tuning the model itself.","Systematically design and refine input prompts to LLMs. This involves crafting clear instructions, providing examples (few-shot learning), specifying output formats, defining roles, and using techniques like chain-of-thought prompting to guide the model's reasoning process. Iterative testing and refinement of prompts are key.","Improved accuracy, relevance, and quality of LLM outputs; better control over model behavior; ability to unlock complex reasoning capabilities; reduced need for model fine-tuning.","Any application involving LLMs, including chatbots, content generation, summarization, question answering, code generation, and data extraction.",
