4552338123,-0.004268762655556202,0.006026081740856171,0.016446160152554512,0.00959982443600893,0.024494264274835587,-0.00439485814422369,-0.0010432021226733923,-0.022097265347838402,0.01265868078917265,0.0013451501727104187,-0.009379622526466846,-0.025167303159832954,-0.016973156481981277,0.012150471098721027,-0.013883966952562332,-0.003797227283939719,0.008760754950344563,-0.0054831416346132755,0.01359429582953453,0.017726123332977295,-0.02705998346209526,Agentic Workflows,"Complex, multi-step tasks often require more than a single LLM call or a simple RAG pipeline. They need a structured approach to orchestrate multiple AI capabilities, tools, and decision points to achieve a larger goal.","Building end-to-end AI applications that involve sequential or parallel execution of tasks, conditional logic, tool invocation, and potentially human-in-the-loop interactions, all coordinated by an AI agent or a system of agents.","Design a structured workflow where an AI agent (or a system of agents) acts as an orchestrator. The agent defines a sequence of steps, makes decisions based on intermediate results, invokes various tools (including LLMs, RAG, external APIs), and manages the flow of information to achieve a complex objective. This often involves defining nodes and edges in a graph-like structure (e.g., LangGraph).",Automation of complex business processes; ability to handle multi-faceted problems; improved reliability and maintainability of AI applications; enhanced adaptability to changing requirements.,"Document processing (patient case summary, contract review, auto insurance claims, research paper report generation), ad sales, general business process automation, complex data analysis.",
