083137288689613,-0.006654792465269566,0.010619017295539379,0.01282820850610733,0.008703000843524933,0.023735329508781433,-0.0013790471712127328,0.014244339428842068,-0.008294673636555672,0.006199592724442482,-0.003870651125907898,-0.010526984930038452,-0.013640830293297768,-0.025228703394532204,0.006215858738869429,-0.01984964683651924,-0.001700420631095767,-0.0007868643733672798,-0.004686824977397919,0.01065556239336729,0.03174284100532532,-0.027481256052851677,Tool Use,"Large Language Models (LLMs) are powerful text generators but have limitations in performing specific, deterministic tasks (e.g., calculations, API calls, database lookups, code execution) or accessing real-time, external information beyond their training data.","Developing LLM-based agents or applications that need to interact with the external world, perform precise operations, access up-to-date information, or execute code to augment their capabilities.","Equip the LLM agent with a set of external 'tools' (e.g., search engines, calculators, APIs, code interpreters, databases). The LLM is prompted to decide *when* to use a tool, *which* tool to use, and *how* to use it (i.e., generating the correct arguments for the tool). The output of the tool is then fed back to the LLM as additional context for further reasoning or generation.","Expanded capabilities of LLMs beyond text generation; improved accuracy for factual queries and calculations; ability to interact with dynamic, real-time data; enhanced problem-solving for tasks requiring external actions; reduced hallucination.","Autonomous agents, complex question answering, data analysis, code generation, web browsing, API integration, scientific research.",
