2474,0.005991396028548479,0.011161400005221367,0.0137864975258708,0.0023464937694370747,0.014170637354254723,-0.0138566754758358,0.0008507600286975503,-0.0018319124355912209,-0.02436935156583786,-0.013783132657408714,-0.012023224495351315,0.008245816454291344,-0.028089433908462524,-0.014022915624082088,0.021658675745129585,0.005424059461802244,0.010208655148744583,0.030318649485707283,-0.01952623762190342,Sparse Thought Generation,"In interactive decision-making tasks, generating a thought at every step can be computationally expensive, verbose, and unnecessary, especially when many actions are simple or repetitive. Dense reasoning might also reduce flexibility.","Decision-making tasks that involve a large number of actions and require reasoning only at critical junctures (e.g., goal decomposition, exception handling, strategic planning), rather than at every single step.","Allow the language model to asynchronously decide when to generate a 'thought' (reasoning trace) and when to generate an 'action'. Thoughts appear sparsely, only in the most relevant positions of a trajectory, such as when decomposing goals, tracking subgoals, determining next steps, or applying commonsense knowledge.","Improves efficiency and flexibility in decision-making tasks by focusing reasoning on critical moments. Demonstrates consistent advantages over controlled baselines with actions only, highlighting the importance of versatile reasoning.","ALFWorld, WebShop.",
