24728560448,0.010949661955237389,0.012301583774387836,0.010309915989637375,0.028948020190000534,0.005058859009295702,0.010937311686575413,-0.004998099524527788,0.016155382618308067,0.006840584333986044,-0.015238863416016102,-0.013506378047168255,-0.03101479448378086,0.007519509177654982,-0.02209949679672718,-0.001362141571007669,-0.0040136766619980335,-0.0048280144110322,0.0013550689909607172,0.036823052912950516,-0.006558062508702278,SayCan (Grounded Robotic Action Planning),"LLMs can generate high-level plans but lack grounding in the physical capabilities and real-world environment of a robot, leading to unexecutable or unsafe actions.",Robotic action planning where an LLM needs to generate a sequence of actions that are physically possible and relevant to the robot's current environment and capabilities.,"Use an LLM to predict possible high-level actions a robot can take. These LLM-generated actions are then reranked by an 'affordance model' that is grounded in the visual environment. The affordance model assesses the physical feasibility and relevance of each action given the robot's current state and surroundings, leading to a final, grounded action prediction.","Enables LLMs to generate robot plans that are grounded in real-world affordances, improving the practicality and safety of robotic actions.",Robotic action planning.,
